# Code owners for meldeng/docs
#
# Owners are teams, never individuals: GitHub never counts a PR author's own
# review, so a single-person owner deadlocks that person's PRs. Each owning
# team needs write access or higher on this repo.
#
# Reviewer assignment comes from the team's GitHub auto-assignment settings
# (two reviewers, load balance), so a PR has named reviewers the moment it
# opens and shows up in the #code-review scheduled reminder.
#
# The last matching rule wins. Verify after merging with:
#     gh api repos/meldeng/docs/codeowners/errors

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @meldeng/backend-engr

# CI/CD, deploy, release and promotion workflows (assume AWS roles, publish
# packages, push images, promote to production).
/.github/               @meldeng/admin

# Ownership itself, kept explicit so narrowing /.github/ later does not
# silently make this file editable under the default rule.
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @meldeng/admin
